{
  "dashboard_name": "Commercial Real Estate Portfolio Dashboard Template",
  "source": "analytics",
  "report": "# Commercial Real Estate Portfolio Operations Report\n\n## Overview\nThis dashboard provides Pinnacle Commercial REIT with portfolio-level visibility into property count, occupancy, NOI performance, lease expiry risk, and the development pipeline across office, retail, and industrial asset classes.\n\n## Key Metrics\n- Portfolio Properties: 24\n- Portfolio Occupancy: 91.7%\n- NOI Variance: 2.3%\n- Lease Expirations (Next 12mo): 8\n- Development Pipeline Value: $142M\n\n## Insights\n- Portfolio occupancy of 91.7% is healthy but 4 assets below 85% occupancy need targeted leasing campaigns — particularly the Retail Center undergoing repositioning.\n- NOI variance of 2.3% is within board-approved tolerance; monitor the Tech Campus Redevelopment as it transitions to stabilized operations.\n- 8 lease expirations in the next 12 months represent $18M+ in at-risk revenue — proactive renewal outreach should begin immediately.",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Portfolio Properties",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Total Portfolio Properties",
            "data_source": "projects",
            "module": "Real Estate",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {}
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "24"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Portfolio Occupancy Rate",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Portfolio Occupancy",
            "data_source": "projects",
            "module": "Real Estate",
            "operation": "percentage",
            "filters": {"status": "Occupied"}
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "91.7%"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "pie",
      "name": "Asset Class Distribution",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Properties by Asset Class",
            "data_source": "projects",
            "module": "Real Estate",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {},
            "group_by": "asset_class"
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "pie chart"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "name": "NOI Trend",
      "data_config": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Net Operating Income",
            "data_source": "projects",
            "module": "Real Estate",
            "operation": "sum",
            "filters": {},
            "field": "noi"
          }
        ],
        "group_by": ["custom_dates"],
        "date_from": "2025-01-01",
        "date_to": "2025-12-31",
        "date_interval": "monthly",
        "aggregation": "count"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bar",
      "name": "Lease Expiry Waterfall",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Lease Expirations by Quarter",
            "data_source": "projects",
            "module": "Real Estate",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {"type": "Lease Expiry"},
            "group_by": "expiry_quarter"
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "waterfall bar"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "name": "Active Lease & Asset Actions",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Open Portfolio Actions",
            "data_source": "ticketing",
            "module": "Real Estate",
            "operation": "list",
            "filters": {"status": ["Open", "In Progress"]}
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "item list"
      },
      "column_count": 4,
      "column_width": 200
    }
  ]
}
